  "native_scope": "Two original sources, each through Clang and LLVM API builder at O0/O2: eight actual executions, each exit 0 with empty stdout/stderr. These are the selected acceptance executions; broader trait and array regressions are not added to this count. The 512-input literal repeats one actual referent, so it does not alone establish distinct-origin indexing; existing dynamic-index and alias controls remain in the selected array suite.",
